                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Data pertaining to systematic experiments conducted with interconnected floating modules. These experiments are part of the Horizon 2020 EU project 'Space@Sea'. The experiments were conducted in the large towing tank of Delft University of Technology and the data is used for multiple purposes such as numerical validation, benchmark data for design of interconnected floating islands and their connection elements, and for further research on wave elevation in gaps between connected modules."
                },
